The companion mainchip_repair_timing_native_reference.tcl contains the repair_timing procedure from The OpenROAD Project revision dcf36133a369abc8f3c5e5738cd4d82e4903c0e0, src/rsz/src/Resizer.tcl. Its procedure name alone was changed. The file copyright notice is Copyright (c) 2019-2025, The OpenROAD Authors. Original project license follows.

